Generate build info JSON file

Usage: elp build-info [OPTIONS] --to <TO>

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  Path to directory with project, or to a JSON file [default: .]
      --to <TO>            Path to a (JSON) file to write the build information
  -h, --help               Print help

Global options:
      --log-file <LOG_FILE>  
      --erl <ERL>            
      --escript <ESCRIPT>    
      --no-log-buffering     
      --no-buck-generated    When using buck, do not invoke a build step for generated files
      --buck-quick-start     Deprecated (no-op): buck project loading always builds generated code
      --color <WHEN>         Use color in output [default: always] [possible values: always, never,
                             auto]
